# Host-side bytecode caches. `python3 -m compileall -q scripts config` (the CI
# check) and any local `import poc_common` write these under the directories
# docker/polychord/Dockerfile COPYs, so without this every build context - and
# every `ri.build-inputs` hash in scripts/build.sh - changes when they appear or
# go away. The images compile their own .pyc with their own interpreter anyway
# (see docker/polychord/Dockerfile).
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
